{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119779","id":3747769639,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7fYm0n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119779","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119779.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119779.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119779","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119779/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119779/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119779/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/675edcee6d4d9d7e9d8fff9483f6ce3e29eea726","number":119779,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add global editor plugin.","user":{"login":"PiCode9560","id":122909224,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1NyKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122909224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560","html_url":"https://github.com/PiCode9560","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/831\r\n\r\nA full implementation of [my global plugin proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/831#issuecomment-4333288607) which implement a global editor-only plugin system to have plugins load into all projects.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nThis PR is based on all of my previous implementations combined into one for **easier testing**, while also separating them into different commits for **easy review**:\r\n\r\n- Closes #111193\r\n- Closes #114823\r\n- Closes #117450\r\n\r\n\r\n### What was added?\r\n\r\nAn editor resource folder in the godot data directory to store global plugins. (e.g. `%APPDATA%/Godot/editor_resources/4.7/addons`)\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>A plugin tab in the editor settings for managing global plugins.</summary>\r\n<img width=\"948\" height=\"585\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f848a2ce-21c0-4a5d-bb33-dd607cb9b6b1\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>A new option in the plugin creation window to set whether the plugin is a project-only, editor-only, or both plugin.</summary>\r\n<img width=\"574\" height=\"616\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da869d8b-5a90-4680-ad0e-3d84062ffccc\" />dd607cb9b6b1\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>An incompatible plugin will have an error shown on it and cannot be enabled.</summary>\r\n<img width=\"1178\" height=\"593\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54cccbcc-bda3-4935-8b5c-fe83f19028d0\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>A global editor directory is created in the godot data directory, and can be accessed in the filesystem.</summary>\r\n<img width=\"346\" height=\"494\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35a6ede2-9f2b-40f0-81ea-1c7780b2dd00\" />\r\n\r\nAlso, there's a button at the top to toggle visibility of the editor directory. Other filesystem related editor for the editor directory was also added.\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Editor Dir Dialog.</summary>\r\nEditor folders only visible if the \"show editor directory\" button from the filesystem dock is on.\r\n<img width=\"359\" height=\"687\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/728f8fd3-11e7-46f9-a61a-8841e7f84b0d\" />\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>File Dialog.</summary>\r\nThe directory edit at the top can edit the path prefix between \"editor://\" and \"res://\". Not sure it this is going to break anything.\r\n<img width=\"1052\" height=\"739\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12a2e18a-1fce-4953-8543-07c6fd897de9\" />\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Asset Store global asset installer.</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7b90d20-a13f-46a8-b235-a685e2e5e640\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n### Usage\r\nTo make a global plugin, go to `editor -> editor settings -> plugins` and create a plugin like you would normally do. In the plugin creation window theres a new option `editor compatibility` to choose whether the plugin is compatible with global plugin, normal project plugin, or both. In the filesystem click on `show editor directory` button to show the global plugin files. \r\n\r\nTo install a global plugin, you can download a plugin normally from the Asset store, then before you install, select the \"Install as Editor-wide\" option. Alternatively you can download a plugin online, extract and place the plugin into the editor resource folder in the godot data directory (e.g. `%APPDATA%/Godot/editor_resources/4.7/addons`). Then turn on the plugin from `editor -> editor settings -> plugins`.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]  \r\n> Some addons will work out of the box, but some will not, because they were referencing resources that is meant to be in `res://` instead of `editor://`. So some modification to the addon is needed.\r\n>\r\n\r\n### TODO\r\n- [x] Add asset store editor plugin installer.\r\n- [ ] Move this to editor settings: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111193#discussion_r2680062994\r\n\r\n### Technical overview\r\n\r\nAs stated many times before, for the `editor://` path prefix implementation, ideally it would be better if https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6307 implemented first, but it is also might be fine without it. A discussion for this is needed.\r\n\r\n### Tested Operating system:\r\n- Windows 11. Tested by (me) @PiCode9560\r\n- Linux. Tested by @rsubtil https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111193#issuecomment-3728799690\r\n- MacOS 15.7.2. Tested by @MartinDelille https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111193#issuecomment-3769193986\r\n- Android not tested yet.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-26T11:14:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T13:43:29Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"56889c6e57489fa57958757eba60a0486b8ca961","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"PiCode9560:global-plugin-ux","ref":"glo